menu "Reactive Smoke Configuration"
    config URBI_ARENA_BYTES
        int "urbi heap arena (bytes, internal SRAM)"
        default 131072
        range 65536 262144
        help
            The static arena the runtime allocates from, the same figure
            the ESP32-S3-EYE demo uses so the smoke measures the board's
            configuration.  The collector is told three quarters of it.
endmenu
